# Testing

- Unit/component tests are **Vitest** in `src/**` and `config/**`
  (`*.test.ts(x)`), jsdom + Testing Library. Assertions use accessible roles
  (`getByRole`) rather than implementation details.
- End-to-end tests are **Playwright** in `tests/e2e`, with a 375px mobile
  viewport and a production server (`pnpm build && pnpm start`). The SEO suite
  walks every sitemap URL and checks one `<h1>`, one canonical, reciprocal
  hreflang and valid JSON-LD.
- When you change prices, durations or structured data, assert against an
  **independently declared expected value** — do not only compare the visible
  price to the JSON-LD price, since both come from the same function.
- Keep `pnpm test` fast and deterministic; avoid network access in unit tests.
- Never weaken or delete a failing assertion to make a change pass.
